  "source_claim": "Ordinary kernel proofs, not source-first PV. The same four explicit RH/generalPerron/Nicolas/BPT source providers construct actual J_upper then actual prime-power correction, then ordinary pi and interval counts. Full raw lower-scale J, min70, entire35-ray preservation and strict whole gain are retained. The .42 scalar bound is a corollary, not optimality or a best-known claim. No official Comparator receipt is asserted."
